{
    "_readme": "One table for the two readers of a GitLab server field: instance_authority / parse_host_field (src-tauri/src/providers/gitlab/mod.rs), which decides where the access token goes, and gitlabInstanceOf (src/utils/gitlabWeb.ts), which the connection form shows before connect. instance is the host[:port] the token is sent to, or null when the field is refused. project is the project path the backend reads (null when refused). A first segment with a dot, a colon or a bracket, or localhost, is an instance; any other is a project owner on gitlab.com. A username with a dot (john.doe/repo) reads as an instance: that is why the form names it.",
